+
+| Distance | Main 4K width in pixels: 8 / 10 / 12 / 16 / 20 mm | 10–12 separation |
+|---:|---|---:|
+| 0.3 m | 68 / 85 / 102 / 136 / 170 | 17.0 px |
+| 0.5 m | 41 / 51 / 61 / 82 / 102 | 10.2 px |
+| 1.0 m | 20 / 26 / 31 / 41 / 51 | 5.1 px |
+| 1.5 m | 14 / 17 / 20 / 27 / 34 | 3.4 px |
+
