+|---:|---:|---:|---:|
+| 300 mm | 3.45–15.38% | 3.45–15.38 mm | 5.17–23.08 mm |
+| 500 mm | 2.04–8.70% | 2.04–8.70 mm | 3.06–13.04 mm |
+| 1000 mm | 1.01–4.17% | 1.01–4.17 mm | 1.52–6.25 mm |
